
---

#### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Distribution / packaging
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*

# Testing / coverage
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
